# Deterministic Gates

Structural gates live in `.specs/harness/scripts/` and require Python 3. A non-zero exit means STOP.

| When | Command |
| --- | --- |
| Before confirming a spec | `python3 .specs/harness/scripts/validate_spec.py .specs/features/[feature]/spec.md` |
| Before approving tasks | `python3 .specs/harness/scripts/validate_tasks.py .specs/features/[feature]/tasks.md` |
| On each commit | `python3 .specs/harness/scripts/check_commit.py --message "<message>"` |
| Before declaring done | `python3 .specs/harness/scripts/validate_state.py .specs/features/[feature]` |

If Python is unavailable, perform the same checks by reading the artifact against the reference checklist.

Persistent state: `.specs/STATE.md` (decisions/handoff), `.specs/LESSONS.md` (lessons learned). Commit `.specs/` via `/handoff` — see `git-handoff.md`.
